00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,841
Second, the ligand changes the colour by changing delta o. Ammonia is higher than water in the spectrochemical series.

2
00:00:08,841 --> 00:00:19,296
It splits the d orbitals more, the absorption shifts to higher energy, and the pale blue aqua complex becomes the deep royal blue ammine complex.

3
00:00:19,296 --> 00:00:21,419
That is the cold open, solved.

